  \resources\Uninstall_NewProfile_One:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz bitta hisob yaratgansiz:
  \resources\Uninstall_NewProfile_HowTo\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu hisoblarni olish tashlash uchun Sozlamalar > Hisoblar > Boshqa foydalanuvchilar bo‘limiga o‘tib, keyin qayta urinib ko‘ring.
