    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Yangi hisoblarni olib tashlash
  \resources\Uninstall_NewProfile_FormatMany:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz %d ta hisob yaratgansiz:
  \resources\Uninstall_NewProfile_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows’ning avvalgi versiyasiga qaytishdan oldin oxirgi yangilanishdan keyin qo‘shilgan foydalanuvchi hisoblarini olib tashlashingiz lozim. Hisoblar, jumladan, ularning profillari butunlay olib tashlanishi lozim.
  \resources\Uninstall_MovedProfile_One:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz bitta hisobni ko‘chirgansiz:
  \resources\Uninstall_MovedProfile_Header:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisobalarni orqaga qaytarish
  \resources\Uninstall_MovedProfile_FormatMany:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz %d ta hisobni ko‘chirgansiz:
  \resources\Uninstall_MovedProfile_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows’ning avvalgi versiyasiga qaytishdan oldin, oxirgii yangilanishdan keyin ko‘chirgan foydalanuvchi hisoblarini asl joyiga qaytarib qo‘yishingiz lozim.
  \resources\Uninstall_MissingExternal_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Sizni Windows’ning avvalgi versiyasiga qaytara olmaymiz, chunki USB fleshka yoki eng oxirgi yangilash vaqtida foydalangan boshqa xotira qurilmangiz mavjud emas. Diskni kiriting va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\Uninstall_InsufficientSpace_Format:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Orqaga qayting, Windows o‘rnatilgan diskda %ws bo‘sh xotiraga ega bo‘lishingiz lozim.
  \resources\Uninstall_InsufficientSpace_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Biroz joy bo‘shating va qaytadan urining.
