  \resources\RenamePC_AAD_UPDATE_FAIL_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: The PC name can’t be updated in Azure Active Directory.
  \resources\RemoveUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisob qaydnoma va ma’lumot yo‘q qilinsinmi?
  \resources\RemoveUser_GeneralErrorText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Tanlangan foydalanuvchini butunlay olib tashlab bo‘lmaydi. Foydalanuvchining ba’zi ma’lumotlari diskda saqlanib qolgan bo‘lishi mumkin.
  \resources\RemoveUser_DeleteUserButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisob qaydoma va ma’lumotlarni yo‘q qilish
  \resources\RemoveUser_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu shaxsning hisob qaydnomasini yo‘q qilish ushbu ShKdan uning barcha ma’lumotlarini, jumladan, ishchi stoldagi elementlar, yuklanmalar, hujjatlar, fotosurat, musiqa va boshqa fayllarni, olib tashlaydi. Agar ushbu ma’lumot rezervlanmagan yoki boshqa ShK kabi boshqa joyga saqlanmagan bo‘lsa, u yo‘qotiladi.
  \resources\RemoveUserLoggedIn_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisob qaydnomani olib tashlab bo‘lmayapti
  \resources\RemoveUserLoggedIn_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Foydalanuvchi hisob qaydnomasini yo‘q qilishingizdan oldin u tizimdan chiqishi lozim. Ularni tizimdan avtomatik ravishda chiqarish uchun ShKingizni qayta ishga tushirishingiz mumkin.
  \resources\RemoveFamilyUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Remove this family member from your device
  \resources\RemoveFamilyUser_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: If you remove this family member from this device, they’ll still be in your family group. We’ll just remove their data from this device, so make sure things like their desktop items, downloads, documents, photos, and music are backed up in another place. Newly added family members will no longer be able to sign in to this device automatically.
  \resources\RemoveExclusion_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Istisnoni olib tashlash
  \resources\RemoveExclusion_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Haqiqatan ham, istisnoni olib tashlamoqchimisiz?
  \resources\RemoveDomainUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisob qaydnomasini olib tashlamoq
  \resources\RemoveDomainUser_DeleteUserButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Olib tashlamoq
  \resources\RemoveDomainUser_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Agar ushbu hisob qaydnomasiga kirishni olib tashlasangiz, undan ushbu ShKga kirishda foydalana olmaysiz.
