    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bekor qilish
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccount_SignInButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisobga kirish usullarini ochish
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccount_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisobingizni himoyalang
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccountDenied_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Masofaviy ish stolini yoqish uchun ushbu hisobda haqiqiylik tekshiruvi talablarini (masalan, Windows Helli, parol yoki PIN kod) belgilashingiz shart.
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccountAllowed_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu kompyuterda hisobingizga kirish uchun sizga hech qanday tekshiruv shart emas. Agar haqiqiylik tekshiruvisiz Masofaviy ish stolini yoqsangiz, kompyuteringizga boshqalar masofadan turib sizdan beruxsat ulanishi mumkin.
  \resources\RDP_Enable_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Masofaviy ish stoli yoqilsinmi?
  \resources\RDP_Enable_Firewall_Part2_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Kengaytirilgan himoya devori sozlamalari
  \resources\RDP_Enable_Firewall_Part1_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz ushbu kompyuterdagi barcha tarmoq ulanishlari uchun himoya devoringizda Masofaviy ish stoli portini ochyapsiz. Agar muayyan tarmoqlarga ulanishni cheklashni xohlasangiz, quyidagini oching:  
  \resources\RDP_Enable_Firewall_Complete_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz ushbu kompyuterdagi barcha tarmoq ulanishlari uchun himoya devoringizda Masofaviy ish stoli portini ochyapsiz. Agar muayyan tarmoqlarga ulanishni cheklashni xohlasangiz, Kengaytirilgan himoya devori sozlamalarini oching.
  \resources\RDP_Enable_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz va Foydalanuvchi hisoblaridan tanlangan foydalanuvchilar ushbu kompyuterga masofadan turib ulana olasizlar.
  \resources\RDP_Disable_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Masofaviy ish stoli faolsizlantirilsinmi?
