  \resources\ManageExclusion_ADD_FAIL_EmptyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Fayl kengaytmalari bo‘sh bo‘la olmaydi yoki faqat bo‘sh joylardan iborat satr
  \resources\Lockdown_SignOutWarningText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Agar belgilangan hisobga kirilgan bo‘lsa, o‘zgarishlar kuchga kirishi uchun mazkur hisobdan chiqib, keyin unga qayta kiring. Tizimga kirilgan hisobdan chiqiladi.
  \resources\LockdownUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisob qaydnoma tanlang
  \resources\LockdownUser_EmptyListText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: The only active account on this device is the current logged in account. Add or create a new account and try again.
  \resources\LockdownApp_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ilova tanlang
  \resources\LockdownApp_EmptyListText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu hisob qaydnoma ilovalarga ega emas. Tanlangan hisob qaydnomasida kamida bitta ilovani o‘rnating va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_RestartHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: ShKingizni qayta ishga tushiring
  \resources\LeaveDomain_RestartBody_DomainUser_Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qayta ishga tushirganingizdan so‘ng ShKingiz %1-dan uziladi. Boshqa hisob qaydnomasi bilan tizimga kirishingiz lozim bo‘ladi, misol uchun avvalgi sahifaga kirish uchun kiritganga o‘xshash.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_RestartBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qayta ishga tushirganingizdan so‘ng ShKingiz %1-dan uziladi.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_NonAdmin_Credentials:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu hisob qaydnoma ma’lumoti ishlamadi. Mahalliy ma’mur hisob qaydnomasi ma’lumotini kiritayotganingizga ishonch hosil qiling va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_NERR_SetupNotJoined:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu ShK domenga qo‘shilmagan.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_Leave_Domain_Failed:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qandaydir muammo yuzaga keldi. Keyinroq qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_Incorrect_Password:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Parol ishlamadi. Uni tekshiring va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmNextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bog‘lamani uzish
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Tashkilotdan chiqish
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmBody_DomainUser_Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: 
      Tashkilot safidan chiqishdan oldin Microsoft hisob qaydnomangiz kabi tashkilotingizga tegishli bo‘lmagan Ma`mur hisob qaydnomasi bilan tizimga kirishingiz lozim.

Tashkilot safidan chiqqaningizdan so‘ng ushbu ShKda tashkilotingizga tegishli hisob qaydnomalari bilan tizimga kira olmaysiz.
    
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bog‘lama uzilgach, bu kompyuterga tashkilotingiz hisobi bilan kira olmay qolasiz.

Agar kompyuterda BitLocker o‘rnatilgan va u ishlab turgan bo‘lsa, BitLocker qayta tiklash kaliti nusxasini ushbu kompyuterdan boshqa joyga saqlab qo‘ying.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_AuthBodyTitle:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Muqobil hisob qaydnomasi ma’lumotlarini kiriting
  \resources\LeaveDomain_AuthBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Tashkilotdan uzilganingizdan so‘ng ushbu ShKga kira olishingizga ishonch hosil qiling, mahalliy ma’mur hisob qaydnomasi uchun kirish ma’lumotlarini kiriting. Bu Microsoft hisob qaydnomasi yoki mahalliy hisob qaydnomasi bo‘lishi mumkin. Agar mavjud bo‘lmasa, uni yaratishingiz lozim bo‘ladi.
  \resources\JoinDomain_RPC_S_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ayni vaqtda domenga ulanib bo‘lmaydi. Ish tarmog‘ingizga ulanganligingizga ishonch hosil qiling va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\JoinDomain_RPC_S_CALL_IN_PROGRESS:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu ShK domenga ulanish jarayonida. ShKingizni qayta ishga tushiring va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\JoinDomain_RestartPCHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: ShKingizni qayta ishga tushiring
  \resources\JoinDomain_NERR_SetupAlreadyJoined:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu ShK oldinroq domenga qo‘shilgan.
  \resources\JoinDomain_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Domenga qo‘shilish
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_NO_SUCH_MEMBER:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu domen hisob qaydnomasini topib bo‘lmadi. Hisob qaydnomasi nomini tekshiring va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_MEMBER_IN_ALIAS:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu ShKda bu hisob qaydnomasi oldinroq o‘rnatilgan.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_INVALID_DOMAIN:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Domenni topib bo‘lmadi. Domen nomini tekshiring va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_DUP_NAME:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu ShK nomi avvaldan ishlatilmoqda. Boshqa ShK nomini tanlang va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Domenga qo‘shilib bo‘lmaydi. Domenga qo‘shilish ruxsatiga ega ekanligingizga ishonch hosil qiling, so‘ngra boshqa ShK nomini kiriting va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\JoinDomain_DomainNameDescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Domen nomi
  \resources\JoinDomain_ConfirmBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qayta ishga tushirganingizdan so‘ng ShKingiz ushbu domenga qo‘shilmaydi: 
  \resources\JoinDomain_CANNOT_JOIN_ERROR:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu domenga qo‘shilib bo‘lmaydi. Qo‘shimcha ma’lumot olish uchun AT ma’muriingiz bilan bog‘laning.
  \resources\JoinDomain_AuthHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Domenga kirish
  \resources\JoinDomain_AuthBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Domenga kirish ruxsatiga ega ekanligingizni tasdiqlash uchun domen hisob qaydnomangiz ma’lumotlarini kiriting.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ADD_LOCAL_USER_FAILED:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qandaydir muammo yuzaga keldi. Keyinroq qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisob qaydnomasi qo‘shish
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserGroupText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Hisob qaydnomasi turi
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserBodyText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu ShKdan foydalanadigan inson uchun hisob qaydnomasi ma’lumotlarini kiriting. Agar ushbu qadamni o‘tkazib yuborsangiz, ushbu foydalanuvchi domen uchun birlamchi ruxsatlarga ega bo‘ladi.
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserAccountText:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Foydalanuvchi hisob qaydnomasi
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_Title:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Fix problems using Windows Update
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_Header:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: We'll repair components and system files
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_ExpeditedSessionCheckBox:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Automatically restart my PC 15 minutes after installation
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_BodyText2\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Please make sure your PC is on and connected to the network and a power source. After installation, we'll let you know when it's time to restart your PC to complete the repair.
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_BodyText1\Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: If a repair solution is available, we'll attempt to fix system component corruption by reinstalling the current version of Windows. Your apps, documents, and settings will be preserved.
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_SucceededHeaderText:
